Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:46:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 2047: the wallet says what the plan adds every week
 (allowancePerPeriod)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Box 53263, item 9: the tokens card read „750 every week" when the plan adds
250. The card shows grantedThisPeriod, which is every credit in the window:
a test seat's opening 500 plus the week's 250. A bought pack inflates it
the same way.

GET /billing/tokens gains allowancePerPeriod: the active plan's grant per
window, read from the same price rows the grant itself uses, and 0 for a
trial or no plan. The subscription read and the per-window grant are
extracted from ensurePeriodGrant, so the grant and the field cannot drift.

FOR_FRONTEND: the contract, and a fallback until it is live.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
